    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i run a small online stationery shop in lyon and i'm a bit worried about gdpr. can u give me a quick summary of the main principles i need to follow since i collect customer emails and shipping addresses for orders? just need the basics for an upcoming audit.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
