      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Hello! Under the GDPR, you must obtain explicit consent from your customers before collecting their emails and shipping addresses. Ensure they understand why this data is being collected, how it's processed, and their rights, including the right to access, rectify, or erase their data. Also, keep records of consent and ensure the data is securely stored and not used for purposes other than initially stated. Breaching these principles could result in hefty fines. Good luck with your audit!",
