    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. i'm especially worried about data security. like, how do i make sure my data isn't being accessed by someone or something \"hidden\" in the background? i want to make sure nothing sneaks in or out of my database without me knowing. any specific tips for a small shop to prevent that kind of thing?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
