      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "For data security, start with strong password policies and two-factor authentication for accessing your database. Use encrypted connections (like SSL/TLS) to transmit customer data. Regularly update your software to patch any security vulnerabilities. Perform data backups and consider using a reputable security solution specifically tailored to small businesses. Frequent security audits can also help to identify potential hidden issues. These steps are vital in protecting your customer's data from unauthorized access.",
